+@tool @tool_installaddon
+Feature: Install plugins page
+  In order to install plugins
+  As an admin
+  I need to be told that installing directly from the plugins directory is unavailable
+
+  Scenario: Install plugins page does not offer installing from the plugins directory
+    Given I log in as "admin"
+    When I navigate to "Plugins > Install plugins" in site administration
+    Then I should see "Installing plugins directly from the Moodle plugins directory is currently unavailable."
+    And "Install plugins from the Moodle plugins directory" "button" should not exist
+    And "Moodle Marketplace" "link" should exist
+    And I should see "Install plugin from ZIP file"
